{'symbol': 'APD', 'date': '2023-06-15 10:15:00', 'title': 'AIR PRODUCTS TO SHOWCASE INDUSTRIAL GAS SOLUTIONS AT THE POWDERMET2023 INTERNATIONAL CONFERENCE ON POWDER METALLURGY AND PARTICULATE MATERIALS', 'text': 'LEHIGH VALLEY, PA. , JUNE 15, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- AIR PRODUCTS (NYSE:APD) WILL SHOWCASE INDUSTRIAL GAS SOLUTIONS AND TECHNOLOGIES FOR METALS AND MATERIALS PROCESSING APPLICATIONS AT THE POWDERMET 2023 INTERNATIONAL CONFERENCE ON POWDER METALLURGY AND PARTICULATE MATERIALS FROM JUNE 19-20 AT CAESARS PALACE IN LAS VEGAS, NEVADA.'}